  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Kelimeler hazır: `words`. Sayım `Counter(words)`.",
      "en": "The words are ready: `words`. The count is `Counter(words)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`return Counter(words).most_common(n)`.",
      "en": "`return Counter(words).most_common(n)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n\ndef top_words(text, n):\n    for mark in \".,!\":\n        text = text.replace(mark, \"\")\n    words = text.lower().split()\n    return Counter(words).most_common(n)\n\nprint(top_words(\"The cat and the hat. The end, and the cat!\", 2))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n\ndef top_words(text, n):\n    for mark in \".,!\":\n        text = text.replace(mark, \"\")\n    words = text.lower().split()\n    return Counter(words).most_common(n)\n\nprint(top_words(\"The cat and the hat. The end, and the cat!\", 2))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "top_words",
      "cases": [
